    <PackageReleaseNotes>## Changes since 10.5.x

### All Packages

#### Added
- Added internal `SafeEnumerator` and `DriveEnumerator` adapters backing safe IO enumeration, exposed to first-party projects via `InternalsVisibleTo`.
- Added consolidated `Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives` extension surfaces (`ArgumentExceptionExtensions`, `StringSegmentExtensions`).
- Added adapter unit tests, public-surface safe-enumeration integration tests, and `Span&lt;char&gt;.RemoveAll` tests (including AOT coverage) plus BenchmarkDotNet benchmarks.

#### Changed
- Retargeted all projects to `net10.0` only; removed `NET8_0_OR_GREATER` guards and dead fallback code across source, tests, and benchmarking.
- Collapsed safe IO enumeration onto the new adapters: `SafeEnumerationExtensions` and `SafeDriveEnumerationExtensions` are now thin wrappers, and `GetRandomIOExtensions` calls the adapters directly.
- Consolidated IO namespaces into `DotExtensions.IO` (merging `IsEmpty` extensions into root `IsEmptyExtensions`); consolidated `StringValues`/`StringSegment`/`ArgumentException` extensions into single files.
- Extracted a shared directory-existence guard in `IsDirectoryEmptyExtensions`; reclassified multi-occurrence test args and added empty-source edge cases.
- Updated README, building, benchmarking, and `DotExtensions.Memory` docs for single-TFM targeting; added a pull request template with AI-usage disclosure; removed redundant planning docs.
- **Runtime Dependencies**: bumped `Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives` to 10.0.12 and `Polyfill` to 11.3.0.
- **Testing Dependencies**: bumped `TUnit` to 1.68.4.
- **CI Dependencies**: bumped `Meziantou.Analyzer` to 3.0.260, `github/codeql-action/upload-sarif` to 4.38.0, and `step-security/harden-runner` to 2.21.1.

#### Deprecated
- Deprecated `PathEnvironmentVariable` (`[Obsolete]`; removal planned for v11).
- Deprecated `TaskTimeoutExtensions.WaitAsync` overloads (`[Obsolete]`; removal planned for v11).

#### Removed
- Removed support for `netstandard2.0`, `net8.0`, and `net9.0`; libraries now ship `net10.0` only.
- Removed netstandard-only package references (`Microsoft.Bcl.Memory`, `System.IO.FileSystem.AccessControl`, `System.Memory`).
- Removed IO sub-namespaces (`Directories`, `Drives`, `Files`) and empty folders — **breaking**: update `using` directives to `DotExtensions.IO`.

#### Fixed
- Addressed code-review findings on the IO enumeration refactor.
- Corrected migration ticket definitions.

[11.0.0-alpha.1]: https://github.com/alastairlundy/DotExtensions/compare/10.5.2...11.0.0-alpha.1</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>A collection of useful extension members and extension methods for .NET .</Description>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Version>11.0.0-alpha.1</Version>
    <PackageId>DotExtensions</PackageId>
      <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    <EnableTrimAnalyzer>true</EnableTrimAnalyzer>
    <TrimmerSingleWarn>false</TrimmerSingleWarn>
      <PolyArgumentExceptions>true</PolyArgumentExceptions>
      <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS0618</NoWarn>
      <AssemblyVersion></AssemblyVersion>
      <FileVersion></FileVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

    <PropertyGroup>
        <IsAoTCompatible>true</IsAoTCompatible>
        <EnableAotAnalyzer>true</EnableAotAnalyzer>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <PropertyGroup>
        <!-- Set to false when packing for release so the test/benchmark InternalsVisibleTo
             attributes are not emitted into the shipped, unsigned assembly. -->
        <ExposeInternalsToFirstPartyProjects Condition="'$(ExposeInternalsToFirstPartyProjects)' == ''">true</ExposeInternalsToFirstPartyProjects>
    </PropertyGroup>
    
    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives" />
        <PackageReference Include="Polyfill" PrivateAssets="all"/>
        <PackageReference Include="Meziantou.Analyzer" PrivateAssets="all"/>
    </ItemGroup>
    
    <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Update="Internal\Localizations\Resources.Designer.cs">
      <DesignTime>True</DesignTime>
      <AutoGen>True</AutoGen>
      <DependentUpon>Resources.resx</DependentUpon>
    </Compile>
  </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup Condition="'$(ExposeInternalsToFirstPartyProjects)' == 'true'">
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DotExtensions.Benchmarking"/>
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DotExtensions.Tests"/>
    </ItemGroup>
    
  <ItemGroup>
    <EmbeddedResource Update="Internal\Localizations\Resources.resx">
      <Generator>ResXFileCodeGenerator</Generator>
      <LastGenOutput>Resources.Designer.cs</LastGenOutput>
    </EmbeddedResource>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="..\README.md">
      <Link>README.md</Link>
      <PackagePath>README.md</PackagePath>
    </Content>
  </ItemGroup>

